n thương khớp, gương toàn cảnh, dàn âm thanh vòm sống động và ánh sáng chuyên nghiệp cho các lớp nhảy sôi động.\n- **Khu Bể Bơi Bốn Mùa Trong Nhà (Sức chứa: 100 người)**: Bể bơi tiêu chuẩn công nghệ lọc nước điện phân muối Clo sinh học, nhiệt độ nước luôn duy trì ấm 29-31°C quanh năm.\n-','[0.006611179, 0.007765866, 0.012718018, -0.03250582, 0.00421344, -0.005635743, -0.018384147, 0.0026638415, -0.0023236254, -0.00592173, -0.010637862, 0.02791892, 0.0057527246, 0.021036614, 0.11326707, -0.0026453824, 0.010142437, 0.01587525, -0.007638076, -0.02111834, -0.014636464, 0.009952631, 0.017597586, 0.0025377849, -0.013973735, 0.0055426727, 0.017546685, 0.00075506495, 0.02184553, -0.020735584, -0.010036058, 0.03708942, 0.026369091, -0.0038653843, -0.002343545, 0.0020847186, 0.0068690986, -0.00070983625, -0.026355507, 0.021860732, -0.013520638, 0.00077204104, 0.0058428664, -0.013916309, 0.00015331681, -0.01930732, 0.0032531763, -0.025755057, 0.014834066, 0.012550894, 0.019964024, 0.013189883, -0.017873872, -0.19290432, 0.009704832, 0.0017244554, -0.020931857, -0.015213265, -0.007592694, -0.013405666, -0.009528154, 0.02517516, -0.045378692, -0.010398596, -0.00664203, -0.014275561, 0.027750429, 0.004199623, -0.008660536, -0.0007214412, -0.011107592, 0.006626662, 0.007790648, -0.008447052, -0.020091867, 0.0027186186, 0.0038289886, -0.0113049075, -0.011999004, 0.01792719, -0.011576219, -0.009975149, -0.012904075, -0.0009885991, 0.0076741935, -0.021460727, 0.0019688893, -0.015249267, -0.017614175, -0.011869382, -0.007583741, 0.011287953, 0.004174028, -0.027858041, -0.00062828604, 0.0077070156, 0.002739962, -0.0018399167, 0.012707535, 0.008459305, 0.01009078, 0.0040068156, -0.018676754, 0.021757204, -0.008388892, 0.0032961094, 0.011688259, 0.0044201016, 0.003953294, -0.0020180566, -0.017557623, -0.013435174, 0.0076525356, -0.0083610285, 0.0062765754, -0.18984884, 0.009909118, -0.014289226, 0.012908329, 0.010799766, -0.004353292, 0.008686088, 0.02261183, -0.009356852, -0.01132252, -